{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7678147882801678602","title":"Agent Harness 开发工程师","description":"1、参与小爱服务端核心系统的研发与维护，支持多业务场景需求，持续提升系统的迭代效率、稳定性与性能。 \n2、参与下一代小爱服务端架构升级，设计并建设面向文本大模型、多模态模型及 Agent 的 Harness 能力，支撑算法流程的快速编排、灰度验证与持续演进。 \n3、参与服务端关键技术问题攻关，围绕高并发、低延迟、稳定性、可观测性等方向持续优化系统能力。 ","requirement":"1、2027届本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、人工智能或相关专业。 \n2、熟练掌握至少一门后端编程语言（java/rust/c++/c#/golang 均可）。\n3、掌握常用数据结构与算法，了解常见设计模式，具备良好的代码设计与工程实践能力。 \n4、了解分布式系统基础，熟悉缓存、消息队列、数据库、分布式存储或计算框架中的一种或多种。 \n5、对大模型、Agent、多模态等方向有兴趣或相关项目经历者优先。 \n6、具备良好的学习能力、主动性与协作意识，愿意面对复杂问题并持续追求技术卓越。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1787708184078,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7678147882801547530","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","